{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "shape", "name": "引言底", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 28.8, "top": 273.6, "width": 399.6, "height": 205.2}}
{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "textbox", "name": "文本框 22", "text": "展示自己，也认真理解别人", "frame": {"left": 43.2, "top": 288.0, "width": 374.4, "height": 61.2}}
{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "textbox", "name": "文本框 21", "text": "参加国际文化节、介绍巴基斯坦文化、体验中国文化。交流不是谁说服谁，而是彼此多理解一步。", "frame": {"left": 43.2, "top": 352.8, "width": 374.4, "height": 111.6}}
{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "image", "name": "图片 29", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 446.4, "top": 61.2, "width": 241.2, "height": 428.4}}
{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "image", "name": "图片 23", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 698.4, "top": 61.2, "width": 234.0, "height": 428.4}}
{"slide": 6, "id": "culture", "kind": "notes", "name": "speakerNotes", "text": "文化交流让我既能自信介绍巴基斯坦，也能更深入理解中国。真正的交流来自好奇、尊重和共同参与。\n\n[Sources]\n- Personal original SYSU International Culture Festival photographs supplied by Heena Rathore."}
