{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "标题 1", "text": "三件小事，比一份完美计划更有用", "frame": {"left": 39.6, "top": 82.8, "width": 878.4, "height": 72.0}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "shape", "name": "建议底1", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 39.6, "top": 172.8, "width": 291.6, "height": 309.6}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议号1", "text": "01", "frame": {"left": 57.6, "top": 183.6, "width": 252.0, "height": 25.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议标题1", "text": "走进一个学术现场", "frame": {"left": 57.6, "top": 216.0, "width": 255.6, "height": 79.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议正文1", "text": "讲座、论坛、读书会都可以。先坐在后排听，再试着问一个问题。", "frame": {"left": 57.6, "top": 302.4, "width": 255.6, "height": 158.4}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "shape", "name": "建议底2", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 345.6, "top": 172.8, "width": 291.6, "height": 309.6}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议号2", "text": "02", "frame": {"left": 363.6, "top": 183.6, "width": 252.0, "height": 25.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议标题2", "text": "做一件对别人有用的小事", "frame": {"left": 363.6, "top": 216.0, "width": 255.6, "height": 79.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议正文2", "text": "志愿不是装饰简历。在真实现场里沟通、等待、负责，本身就是训练。", "frame": {"left": 363.6, "top": 302.4, "width": 255.6, "height": 158.4}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "shape", "name": "建议底3", "text": "", "frame": {"left": 651.6, "top": 172.8, "width": 291.6, "height": 309.6}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议号3", "text": "03", "frame": {"left": 669.6, "top": 183.6, "width": 252.0, "height": 25.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议标题3", "text": "介绍一次自己的来处", "frame": {"left": 669.6, "top": 216.0, "width": 255.6, "height": 79.2}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "textbox", "name": "建议正文3", "text": "也认真听别人的来处。交流不是说服，是彼此多理解一步。", "frame": {"left": 669.6, "top": 302.4, "width": 255.6, "height": 158.4}}
{"slide": 7, "id": "advice", "kind": "notes", "name": "speakerNotes", "text": "收束到新生可以立刻做的三件事，避免空泛鸡汤。"}
